Tt0x8QBsbpiBm2QaTJTCo26FHWhpnHsk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR84BJ6cNY9cO0Tny9FnsG3yNcHI5qbFx8O2r4L5OXdtQ&oe=6B046A89"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TubeTimeCover2560x1440.png", "id": "684711803939453", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391964_684711807272786_151384255056230118_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UuST2s9IAZcQ7kNvwGQ244l&_nc_oc=AdpJDrTzpUMRHjo9y6K9PhXZh82fw1ScAreJcxiFAL7dEtXEpp2t9iZYkLDm2j8ioSw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT-bLDSy6XGRhHeyNZRelaEWi2wzTF4sk5X9nhFgsZyiQ&oe=6B0488B4"}, "display_name": "Tube Time", "keywords": ["Tubing", "Relaxation", "Scenery", "Nature", "Rivers"], "long_description": "\ud83c\udfdc\ufe0f Hop in, Float On, and Chill!\n\nGrab your tube and drift into a serene VR escape\u2014ride sun-kissed rivers, explore stunning canyons, and vibe with friends as the sky shifts around you in real-time. \n\nThis is Tube Time.\n{1058100459587220}\n\n\ud83d\udea3 Float With Friends\nSquad up or go solo\u2014it\u2019s your river, your adventure! Laugh, chat, and explore in a one-of-a-kind social VR experience.\n{2139569103165849}\n\n\ud83c\udf05 Every Ride is a New Adventure\nFrom golden sunrises to misty moonlit drifts, dynamic weather and a day-night cycle keep things fresh every time you float.\n{3073192249501392}\n\n\ud83d\udca6 Dive In Today!\nGrab your tube and make a splash\u2014Tube Time is waiting!\n\n\n", "short_description": "Hop in and float through beautiful landscapes with friends! I\u2019ve created Tube Time as a chill escape where you can relax, enjoy stunning scenery, and have fun together. Every session feels fresh with changing weather and day/night cycles.\n\nI\u2019m still hard at work building Tube Time and would love your feedback. Reach out on Discord or email me. Thanks for your support!\n\nMatt\nmattc@zippyelf.com\nwww.zippyelf.com"}]}, 